    "text": "[0:00] aaj hamara de 76 hai aur de 76 men main aapako\n[0:04] ek eksarasaij dene vala hun jisamen aapako\n[0:06] karana kya hai mainipulet karana hai pidieph\n[0:08] phails ko aur yah aapako karana hai paip pidieph\n[0:11] modyul ka istemal karake to hamara paip\n[0:13] pidieph nam ka ek modyul hota hai jisake\n[0:15] sahayata se aap log pidieph phails ko marj\n[0:17] kar sakate ho jaise main lo mainne aapako panch chhah\n[0:19] pidieph phails de di aap unako ek men marj\n[0:21] kar sakate ho aur aap agar chaho to usamen kuchh\n[0:24] aur phankshanailitij bhi aid kar sakate ho yu aar\n[0:26] velakam bat yahan par aapako marjing vali\n[0:29] phankshanailiti hai vo banani hai to aap log\n[0:31] kya karana ki aapake pas main lo sat pidieph\n[0:33] phails hain to un saton ki sat pidieph\n[0:35] phails ko ek singal pidieph men kaise marj\n[0:38] karana hai ye aapako program likhana hai ab aap\n[0:41] kahoge kis ordar men mere karen pahale kaun\n[0:42] sa pej aana chahie dusara kaun sa pe jana\n[0:44] chahie to yar ye chij hamen kam karate hain ham\n[0:47] log jo bhi alphabetik sorting hai usako\n[0:49] menten rakhenge aur usake hisab se sort jo\n[0:52] bhi agar aap chaho karana chaho jaise bhi vo kar\n[0:54] sakate ho bat ek partikular tarah ki pidieph\n[0:58] phail ko pahale aapako lena hai to vo bhi kar\n[1:00] sakate vah bhi posibal hai\n[1:04] paee pidieph ko eksaplor karen jo ki bahut\n[1:06] hi kamal ki opan sors pure paithan pidieph\n[1:09] laibreri hai aap spliting marjin\n[1:11] kroping aur isamen inakorp bhi kar sakate hain\n[1:14] pidieph phails vagaira ko kaphi mainne use ki\n[1:16] huee hai apane kaphi klaints ko projekt\n[1:17] bana ke die hue hain sirph is laibreri se\n[1:19] mainne kaphi paise kamae tu bhi onest aapako\n[1:22] main batana chahata hun kyonki jab kya hota\n[1:23] hai na kisi ko ek pis oph sophtaveyar banavana\n[1:25] hota hai aur unako sirph apane kamon se matalab\n[1:28] hota hai jaise ki mera ek klaint tha\n[1:30] unhonne ek pidieph phail banava thi mujhase\n[1:33] tin pidieph phails unako mere karana unake\n[1:35] lie ek bahut bari bat thi aur hoti bhi hai\n[1:37] yar ye modyul na ho ham paithan men\n[1:39] tin-char panch aath lain ka kod likh ke kam kar\n[1:41] le agar to hamare lie chij aasan ho jati hai\n[1:43] bat use insan ke lie chij bahut bari bat\n[1:45] hoti hai to main yujuali vindoj men kam\n[1:47] kaise karata hun ek dot bat phail banate to\n[1:48] jo ki meri paithan phail ko invok karati hai\n[1:50] usase ye hota hai ki main klaint ke\n[1:53] kanpyutar men paithan instol kar deta hun\n[1:54] ya phir usako ek epiaaee bana ke de deta hun\n[1:56] aur ek sarvar par host kar deta hun aur usako\n[1:59] bata deta hun to vahi sarvar aapako rakhana hai\n[2:01] ya phir agar vah sarvar aap nahin rakhana chahate\n[2:04] hain to sinpali main paithan unake kanpyutar\n[2:05] men instol karake setaap karake usaki bhi\n[2:08] otometik skript banakar de deta hun\n[2:09] varn portebal paithan karake bhi ek chij hoti\n[2:11] hai to ye sari chij paee instalar bhi hoti\n[2:14] hai ek chij jaise ki puri ek hi ban jati hai\n[2:16] paithan ki vo bhi ham dekhenge aage bat abhi ke\n[2:19] lie aapako is eksarasaij ko solv kar rahe\n[2:21] hain aur jo bhi isako solv karega usako main\n[2:22] shut aaut dunga so gais ye vidiyo jo hai vo\n[2:25] main raipid ki mobail aip se bana raha hun aur\n[2:27] main aapake lie treval kar raha hun aur kaphi\n[2:30] jyada biji chal raha hai shedyul bat 100\n[2:32] dez oph kort mis nahin kar raha tha koee sa\n[2:34] bhi din to isalie mainne raipid mobail aapase\n[2:36] ye vidiyo bana raha hun to yar aap paee\n[2:37] pidieph ko jarur se eksaplor karana aur\n[2:39] isamen bahut sari baten likhi huee hai isaki\n[2:43] dokyumenteshan men aap log agar isaki\n[2:44] dokyumenteshan men jaoge to kaphi chij isake\n[2:46] bare men aapako sikhane ko milegi ye paip\n[2:49] pidieph ka rid di dogs men khol raha hun\n[2:51] apane phon men aur aap log yahan par dekh sakate\n[2:53] ho ki phaiv pidieph tu ise an phri end opan\n[2:56] sors laibreri men bahut sare egjanpals\n[2:57] bhi hai to kam se kam marj to bahut hi sinpal\n[3:00] si chij hai vah aap dekh kar yah jo hamara\n[3:03] kveshchan hai isako solv kar sakate ho aur main\n[3:05] chahata hun ki aap log karo isako solv so aap\n[3:07] sabhi log isako jarur solv karana thaink yu so\n[3:09] mach gais phor vaching dis vidiyo end aaee vil\n[3:11] si yu nekst taim"
